			<td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;height:19px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">4-босқич</span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:1%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;height:19px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"></p>
			</td>
			<td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:23%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;height:19px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Халқ депутатлари туман (шаҳар) Кенгашлари</span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:1%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;height:19px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"></p>
			</td>
			<td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:46%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;height:19px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none">
			<p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:10.2pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Кўрсатиладиган иссиқлик таъминоти хизматлари учун тартибга солинадиган янги нархларни (тарифларни) қайта кўриб чиқади ва маъқулланган тақдирда тасдиқлайди.</span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:1%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;height:19px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"></p>
			</td>
